{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_041_01_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:7793004770b7bdb304da2a32fb970303a27b3f7de8b59531e3ac3169df312c8f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_d:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94c47e71a7f809652716c93dcac4901345742e2813115851d14db6b4d4bcc329",
      "text": "数分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_d:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:584093e6dbeec4a4a9d9e5cade6f054484797ca20364aa5afb4fa7172119ef2f",
      "text": "谢谢你帮我处理伤口。\n已经没事了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_d:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b2a26787e65a38d4d1c1170b64f5f41a39ae5340d61579235ca1324fad810a8",
      "text": "太好了。\n不过，请千万不要勉强自己哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_d:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9388fa8f44a9adb2232c07562fc0cfc18810de264bcc896639c31377959859b4",
      "text": "好的。……话说回来，迅速帮我\n处理伤口的凉先生，非常帅气哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_d:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc60d6e10566f432c42e07cfa7d82824b20e6579a9f563badb30b2628aae7be7",
      "text": "真、真的吗！？\n哎嘿嘿……有点害羞呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_d:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aba0ce31c870706a15eca465bd527bfa2fa14a3d775dffa6b9005d759e5268d2",
      "text": "危险，●●●●プロデューサー！\n……当时是这种感觉吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_d:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f57ef8a65aaaeea103b52b097cf65f0871d56681930f44cab0d0683577d756b6",
      "text": "啊、奇怪？感觉哪里不对？呜呜，好没气势……\n总、总之，我们继续回去做布丁吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_d:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5edbfd494199ac64f17c4c72115fdf0c543a57a35d069cb6e86db75e8ae0f225",
      "text": "那个，糖已经放过了对吧。\n那我就尝尝味道……咦？好咸！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_d:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c195418fc219f66e6dc06966648cdcccd92b35e4ee43247b91924dc13b26d550",
      "text": "啊、对、对不起！我好像把盐和糖\n给搞混放错了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_d:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:26b0589119ab6522d86c72d77f32d8bc3cb5f04a9466cdc0457ce170a4202cc8",
      "text": "刚才开始就一直在给凉先生添麻烦，\n真的很对不起……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_d:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:008b8298ca0ad59d55e6c37280ba12b31cd0cd01409aa5d75148ecc9ccd94266",
      "text": "没事的，●●●●プロデューサー。\n我有一个好主意！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_d:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ac17e170bf60dddfe05fc7caecd0ce77d43693a3c1108e3332f82ba60a120ba",
      "text": "好主意……？",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
